{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Chiral active fluid of rotating disks: trajectory data of N=10 particles in a circular confinement at packing fraction 0.10",
    "description": "Trajectory data from a chiral active fluid experiment with rotating disk particles driven by air flow. The dataset contains particle positions (x, y) for N=10 particles at packing fraction 0.10. This experiment was recorded at a low frame rate and therefore contains only translational information (no orientation angle theta and no angular velocity). Recordings were performed at 250 fps using a high-speed camera. The data is provided in CSV format with one file per experimental condition. The confinement is circular with a diameter of 0.725 m.",
